      {
        "content": "AhnLab SEcurity intelligence Center (ASEC) recently identified the distribution of GuLoader malware via a phishing email by impersonating a famous international shipping company. The phishing email was obtained through the email honeypot operated by ASEC. The mail body instructs users to check their post-paid customs tax and demands them to open the attachment.",
